			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2027796">
									

<p>And I would downvote that article for the same reason, because it flies in the face of the overwhelmingly standard depiction of the O5 as competent, dispassionate <em>ordinary human beings</em> who do not ever interact with SCP objects in any way. When you start portraying the leaders of the Foundation as a clique semi-immortal superhumans who hunt down paranormal objects so they can use them for their own personal benefit (and nobody else's) in ways bordering on lolfoundation, it completely breaks the notion of why the Foundation exists.</p>
