<blockquote>
<p>For starters, there's a strict rule that the O5s are never supposed to come into contact with anomalous objects.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>There's no canon. The O5s can do whatever the author can get away with them doing. Seeing as how we just had a fairly well-received series of tales in which the Foundation is run by a person running an asston of other GoIs, I don't really view this skip as somehow radically outside of the range of how Overseers are portrayed.</p>
<p>This isn't necessarily my portrayal of them, but &quot;strict rule&quot;? No. Not at all.</p>

