<p>I would gladly do so, were I given the necessary permission.</p>
<p>The framework that SCP was built on constitutes a canon, whether you like it or not. The voice of the people might be a strong factor in what works and what doesn't, but it's not the <em>only</em> factor and without going into the months-long argument about it, isn't even necessarily the most important one.</p>
